Reinforcement Learning, Explained Through Experiments

The Mars Rover task specification is adapted from Vizuara AI Labs,
RL in Production, Lecture 01:
https://rl-bootcamp-decks.vercel.app/pdfs/lecture-01-assignment.pdf

The repository provides an implementation, reproducible experiments, and original
explanatory prose about established reinforcement-learning algorithms. The exercise
PDF and lecture slides are not redistributed. References to third-party materials
do not change the rights associated with those materials.
